msgstr ""
"Parameter area: `Grouping rule`, `Alignment mode`, `Maximum generations`,"
" `Population size`, and `Convergence tolerance`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7539
#: 01acf940e7824e869ee333d224dbf8be
msgid "保存区：`保存为基线预设`和`预设名称`。"
msgstr "Save area: `Save as baseline preset` and `Preset name`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7540
#: cfa806d494af4ad8bbc9992af74ea046
msgid "执行结果：后台拟合/应用基线平移并重绘。"
msgstr ""
"Result: fit and apply the baseline shift in the background, then redraw "
"the plot."

